## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gamepad Reticle On Target
## Notes: Puts the controller's reticle on your target's nameplate, so it stays on what you attack, and can keep its tooltip shown. Settings in Options > AddOns > Gamepad Reticle On Target, or /gprt.
